# General QA Rules (eFMS / eTMS)

Full reference: `ruleAi.md` Sections 3.7–3.11, 16.

## Architecture

| Layer | Location | Responsibility |
|-------|----------|----------------|
| Page objects | `src/automation/pages/` | Locators + UI actions only |
| Tests | `tests/{app}/` | Test logic + **assertions** |
| Fixtures | `tests/conftest.py`, `tests/{app}/conftest.py` | Browser, login, `pages` |
| Config | `src/automation/config/settings.py` | Credentials via `.env` |
| Test data | `tests/testdata/dataTest-*.json` | Business data — no secrets |

## Assertions

- **Tests only** — `assert` with descriptive message
- Page Objects: `wait_for_visible()` raises; `is_*_displayed() -> bool`
- Use `pytest.skip(reason)` — not `assert False` — for missing preconditions

## Test data

- Credentials: `efms_account_password` / `etms_account_password` fixtures only
- Unique fields: generate with timestamp / `uuid` — never hardcode
- JSON key = test function name exactly

## Waits

- No `time.sleep()` or raw ms literals — use `settings.*_timeout` / `settings.*_ms`
- Prefer `wait_for_visible`, `click_when_ready`, condition waits (Section 3.6)

## Before delivery

- No debug `print()`, commented code, or probe scripts left behind
- Do not delete source files without user confirmation
- Run `uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format .`
